   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"7\">\n    <li>Is the following relation a function? Explain your answer.<br> <img alt=\"This figure shows two table that each have one column. The table on the left has the header “Name” and lists the names “Neal”, “Krystal”, “Kelvin”, “George”, “Christa”, and “Mike”. The table on the right has the header “Phone number” and lists the numbers “123-567-4389 work”, “231-378-5941 cell”, “753-469-9731 cell”, “567-534-2970 work”, “684-369-7231 cell”, “798-367-8541 cell”, and “639-847-6971 cell”. There are arrows that start at a name and points toward a number in the phone number table. The first arrow goes from Neal to 753-469-9731 cell. The second arrow goes from Krystal to a 684-369-7231 cell. The third arrow goes from Kelvin to 231-378-5941 cell. The fourth arrow goes from George to 123-567-4389 work. The fifth arrow goes from George to 639-847-6971 cell. The sixth arrow goes from Christa to 567-534-2970 work. The seventh arrow goes from Mike to 567-534-2970 work. The eighth arrow goes from Mike to 798-367-8541 cell.\" src=\"exercises/media/e791deea196ea7fe.jpg\"></li>\n  </ol>",
